	)
	(text "Duty Cycle: D = Vₒ/(V_{S} + Vₒ) = 75/(50 + 75) = 0.6\n\nSwitching Frequency: f_{s} = 100kHz (Selected)\n\nLoad Resistance: R = Vₒ/Iₒ = 75/5 = 15Ω (Minimum Allowable Load Resistance)\n\nCapacitor currents all equal 0. \n\nAverage inductor2 current (I_{L2}) = Diode current = Iₒ\n\nPower Source = Power Load = I_{o}V_{o} = 5A*75V = 375W\n\nAverage inductor1 current (I_{L1}) = Average input current = I_{S} = P_{s}/V_{s} = 375/50 = 7.5A\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.574 65.532 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.1875)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "95bc965d-bac6-4020-ae3d-3f2271ec0bae")
	)
	(text "Design SEPIC Converter with following:\nDC input of V_{S} = 50V\nDC output of V_{o} = 75V\nOutput current of I_{o} = 5A\n1% output ripple voltage\n2% capacitor ripple voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.828 34.544 0)
