	(text_box "The LM3478MA is a common chip used Boost, SEPIC, and Flyback converters.\nData Sheet holds all the equations for component sizes and ratings.\n\nThis particular design should be capable of accepting 12V at ~2A and can output 24V(1A) down to 5V(4.8A).\nWe opperate at duty cycles between 30% to 70% to achieve this.\n\nFDD8451 and MBRS340 are more than capable of handling the voltage and current in this given circuit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.208 49.276 0)
		(size 81.788 19.812)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28aa5825-1913-48a5-8a14-fe5226ba3a51")
	)
	(text_box "DR : Drive pin that drives MOSFET get\nFB : Feedback pin functions by adjusting the duty cycle such that it sees 1.26V\nISEN : Current sense input pin. Voltage generated by external resistor is feed to this pin\nCOMP : Output of error amplifier, connected RC network stabilizes feedback and determines how fast converter responds to changes in load/input.\nFA/SD : Frequency adjust/shutdown pin. Resistor sets oscillator frequency. Highlevel longer than 30us will turn device off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 133.604 0)
		(size 125.73 13.208)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "700d8caf-1629-4948-8718-66f3c50e0d30")
	)
	(text_box "A Single-Ended Primary Inductor Converter (SEPIC) is a DC-DC converter that can produce an output voltage either higher or lower than the input voltage while maintaining the same output polarity. It transfers energy through two inductors and a series coupling capacitor, making it useful for applications where the input voltage varies above and below the desired output voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.716 39.37 0)
		(size 136.906 7.62)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "df467f23-e870-4bcc-9372-228dda29a7f9")
	)
